// A closing bracket inside a step keeps the later steps.
// A closing brace inside a step keeps the letters after it.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE brace ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG brace law

IMPULSE brace 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "brace" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
